%% Figure 3.3: State lifecycle of a standard civic report.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingValidation
    PendingValidation --> Open: Community accepts
    PendingValidation --> CommunityRejected: Community rejects
    CommunityRejected --> PendingValidation: Approved revote
    Open --> InProgress: Authority starts work
    Reopened --> InProgress: Authority restarts work
    InProgress --> PendingVerification: Solution is submitted
    InProgress --> PendingRejectionReview: Rejection is submitted
    PendingVerification --> Closed: Community accepts solution
    PendingVerification --> Reopened: Community rejects solution
    PendingRejectionReview --> Closed: Community upholds rejection
    PendingRejectionReview --> Reopened: Community accepts appeal
    Closed --> [*]
